# Quest for Fishing Shot (Q426): a started character kills monsters of each table of the quest: a draw
# up to the monster's chance gives one fluid more than its sure ones (the chance itself too), and a
# monster of two tables answers by the first. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
